OL,3,GNEWSADay centre set to shut gets last
OL,4,Aminute reprieve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that was due to close later
OL,7,Fhas been given a last gasp reprieve to
OL,8,Fcontinue operating for at least another
OL,9,Ftwo months.
OL,11,FAge Concern Twyford, struggling
OL,12,Ffinancially after a decline in
OL,13,Fmembership and donations, was told by
OL,14,FWokingham Borough Council on Thursday
OL,15,Fthat it would receive new funding,
OL,16,Fahead of a planned closure on Friday.
OL,18,FDebs Heffernan, the centre's care
OL,19,Fmanager, said the authority's
OL,20,Fintervention to keep it open until the
OL,21,Fend of October was "fantastic" for
OL,22,Fmembers and staff.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
